  "representation": "Reuse frozen ranked104 mean4/risk10 coordinates, eight source identities and unchanged same-source GP. Public control descriptors are geometry-independent; inherit the prior representation proof. Starting from the previous joint source calibration, fit one multiplier of the original g task covariance per dominant spectral/head_specific identity. Apply the multiplier consistently to source/query task priors; keep the prior mean, common covariance, added mean4 variances and eta prior parameters fixed. Reweight eta-component and outer identity masses by the updated source evidence. Target geometry parameters and outcomes do not enter source fitting or representation.",
